<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-12T03:57:42.316Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:57:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities detained 14 suspected Sinaloa cartel members in Chiapas, two of whom are believed to be regional leaders. A slain cartel boss known as The General is alleged to have provided fake police identification to fugitive gang member Ryan Wedding to facilitate drug trafficking. U.S. prosecutors indicted a Los Angeles gang member and a cartel boss for helping Ryan Wedding evade capture. A police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7‑year-old American girl. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;newscentermaine.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFB6YzVBS2pGQVBtOWVwRWNIaFFuT3B6OThHOHQzazRFUFk4N0JTZldpdEtjaGxpVkRleXdzeTI4OXJQREMtbmZvenBESE1uaC03ZUt0S0owakIzb05ieTZlVzB5bFp0MlhXTzJqRWdrb1k?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mexico News Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQbWNMWUtQaXV5eGZzR0xXdkxOVmNIOVZXWUVhdGVwTk1tYjg3QWsybUlFcl9zLW1xNHluRmU3NkRnazQwZTlnQXA4ampmdXhKV2x1aFNqQmczcm16dG9ocm1rcmlUVlc5V1BuWEV3V282cURQUVl1RXBQbU9WY2hUSlV4eG02bVRMNW5HcHljalBjUFJuSTBXdWFlbGw0eERnbnZTaVlyM1JUQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WMTW&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOX2poMEk4Z2VpRnBTcXJua3dRd2EwZWxSOHN0c29HRG5VWWJtNFF2RXBaU2g3amhiaWJSNlhCUjBJRjN0TEZVZVJTcHVkNjZNczVhQUVyYTBGSWl2R0dWMlF3dFZKTmluTjR1a0lXdWVaaUduRVg2TUQxakVVUlBDOTZSeW1qQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 11 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQdE5NVHVHaEw5Y0c1cmk2MmlDbElRTk1JeXBrZ2NXQUhZVDg4ODJ2M2FyQnpZQjVoT0doRW9uNTBOVm5mdlRpaDUtVG9NdjlhTnhnYnpVS0V4N0ZSTjRfOEdjUF9JWWRoQzlmQWZFM0l4aDRDTk8xbzhtUGpvaEtnS3ZWajNsaXY2YXVo